    "q-d12-42": "Closer INR monitoring and warfarin dose adjustment",
    "q-d12-46": "Monitored amiodarone prophylaxis",
    "q-d12-47": "High thromboembolic risk despite no definite thrombus",
    "q-d12-50": "Increase output, verify capture, and prepare backup pacing",
